        "created_at": "2014-12-23T06:07:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If Baron Blade uses Devious Disruption, which heroes have to discard tokens? &nbsp;All heroes, all heroes within 6 hexes, or all heroes within 6 hexes that are in LOS? &nbsp;<span>In another thread, I saw one statement I'm skeptical of but, if true (they said all heroes regardless of range/LOS), would change the dynamic significantly (making it a far more powerful power than I read it as).</span></p>",
